{"seq":3,"slug":"bonded-repair-volume-cycle-metric","title":"维修周期/料件核销率与运营指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/repair-supervision-ops/bonded-repair-volume-cycle-metric","wordCount":2296,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"维修周期-料件核销率与运营指标\">维修周期/料件核销率与运营指标</h1><p>一个保税维修中心如果只看一个数字，应该看什么？不是营收，不是产能，而是<strong>核销周期内未了结货物的价值</strong>。这个数字同时反映了三件事：有多少货在区内、对应多少暂缓税款、以及离核销还有多长时间。它涨得太快意味着业务扩张超过了账册容量，涨得太久意味着维修或处置在某个环节卡住了。围绕它展开的一组指标，构成了保税维修运营的仪表盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保税维修的指标与普通维修中心有一个根本差别：<strong>它是双向计分的</strong>。普通维修只看效率——修得越快越好、周转越高越好。保税维修还要看账册健康——货出得越慢，逾期的风险越高；料件耗用越快，核销的压力越大。一对看似冲突的目标（快速处置 vs 账册平衡）在核销周期这个标尺上被统一起来：<strong>核销周期是约束，其他指标都在这个约束下优化</strong>。这个约束的法定边界是明确的：保税维修核销周期原则上最长不超过 1 年，飞机、船舶等大型装备维修企业经主管海关确认可按合同实际有效期确定（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2018-12/31/content_5447554.htm\">海关总署公告2018年第203号</a>）；而&quot;不得跨年度办理&quot;集中申报的要求，进一步把年度末变成了实际的清账时点（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-03/30/content_5682479.htm\">《中华人民共和国海关综合保税区管理办法》第二十四条</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[核销周期&lt;br/&gt;硬约束] --&gt; B[维修周期&lt;br/&gt;单台在区时长]&#10;  A --&gt; C[料件核销率&lt;br/&gt;耗用/进口]&#10;  A --&gt; D[账册差异率&lt;br/&gt;对不上的比例]&#10;  A --&gt; E[在区敞口&lt;br/&gt;暂缓税款余额]&#10;  B --&gt; F[运营效率]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; G[合规健康]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; H[综合评分]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{是否需要干预}&#10;  I --&gt;|差异率升| J[收紧工单时长阈值]&#10;  I --&gt;|敞口逼近担保| K[加快处置或扩容]&#10;  I --&gt;|核销率低| L[排查结转与剩余料件]\">graph TD\n  A[核销周期&lt;br/&gt;硬约束] --&gt; B[维修周期&lt;br/&gt;单台在区时长]\n  A --&gt; C[料件核销率&lt;br/&gt;耗用/进口]\n  A --&gt; D[账册差异率&lt;br/&gt;对不上的比例]\n  A --&gt; E[在区敞口&lt;br/&gt;暂缓税款余额]\n  B --&gt; F[运营效率]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; G[合规健康]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; H[综合评分]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{是否需要干预}\n  I --&gt;|差异率升| J[收紧工单时长阈值]\n  I --&gt;|敞口逼近担保| K[加快处置或扩容]\n  I --&gt;|核销率低| L[排查结转与剩余料件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>主要观测目的</th>\n<th>恶化信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维修周期中位数</td>\n<td>从工单创建到关闭的天数</td>\n<td>运营效率与瓶颈定位</td>\n<td>中位数上升且尾部变厚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>料件核销率</td>\n<td>已耗用 ÷ 已进口保税料件</td>\n<td>核销压力与料件管理</td>\n<td>持续低于预期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账册差异率</td>\n<td>盘点差异数量 ÷ 盘点总量</td>\n<td>账册健康</td>\n<td>无成因差异占比上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在区敞口</td>\n<td>在区货物对应暂缓税款</td>\n<td>担保额度占用</td>\n<td>逼近担保上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副产物处置完成率</td>\n<td>已处置 ÷ 已登记副产物</td>\n<td>处置流程完整性</td>\n<td>长期低于 100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"维修周期的度量与瓶颈\">维修周期的度量与瓶颈</h2><h3 id=\"从工单创建到关闭\">从工单创建到关闭</h3><p>维修周期应当按<strong>工单创建到工单关闭</strong>的天数计算，而不是按进境到出境。原因在于这两个口径回答不同问题：进境到出境包含了在库等待与物流时间，适合做财务与额度预测；工单创建到关闭只包含维修作业本身，适合定位运营瓶颈。保税维修的指标看板通常两个都要，但优化时盯后者——因为只有后者是维修中心自己可控的。</p>\n<p>度量时要注意<strong>中位数与尾部的分离</strong>。维修周期的分布通常是长尾的：大多数工单几天内关闭，少数因料件等待或技术难题拖成数月。只看均值会被尾部掩盖，实际体验是&quot;均值五天，但总有百分之几的货卡住不动&quot;。因此报告应同时给出中位数（典型体验）与 P90 或超阈值比例（尾部风险）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 维修周期分布：中位数与尾部&#10;SELECT&#10;  percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (&#10;    ORDER BY EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (completed_at - opened_at)) / 86400&#10;  ) AS median_days,&#10;  percentile_cont(0.9) WITHIN GROUP (&#10;    ORDER BY EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (completed_at - opened_at)) / 86400&#10;  ) AS p90_days,&#10;  count(*) FILTER (&#10;    WHERE completed_at - opened_at &gt; interval &#39;60 days&#39;&#10;  )::numeric / NULLIF(count(*), 0) AS over_60d_ratio,&#10;  count(*) AS wo_count&#10;FROM repair_work_order&#10;WHERE completed_at &gt;= $cycle_start AND completed_at &lt; $cycle_end;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 维修周期分布：中位数与尾部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opened_at)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opened_at)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p90_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opened_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> over_60d_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wo_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_work_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_end;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>over_60d_ratio</code> 是这三个数字里最该设阈值的。中位数和 P90 会随业务结构变化而缓慢漂移，而&quot;超过 60 天的工单占比&quot;是一个清晰的运营红线——它直接对应核销逾期风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时长异常的归因维度\">时长异常的归因维度</h3><p>当一个工单超期时，需要知道卡在哪一段。可行的做法是把工单拆成几个阶段并分别计时：<strong>待检测、待料件、维修中、待出境</strong>。四个阶段的超期原因完全不同——待检测是排产问题，待料件是供应链问题，维修中是技术问题，待出境是物流或单证问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;wo_stage_timing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;wo_id&quot;: &quot;WO-2026-0921-4471&quot;,&#10;    &quot;stages&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;WAITING_INSPECTION&quot;, &quot;days&quot;: 2 },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;WAITING_MATERIAL&quot;, &quot;days&quot;: 41, &quot;flag&quot;: &quot;EXCEEDED&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;IN_REPAIR&quot;, &quot;days&quot;: 6 },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;WAITING_SHIPMENT&quot;, &quot;days&quot;: 9, &quot;flag&quot;: &quot;NEAR_LIMIT&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;dominant_bottleneck&quot;: &quot;WAITING_MATERIAL&quot;,&#10;    &quot;note&quot;: &quot;该工单超期由料件等待主导，指向备件计划而非维修产能&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"wo_stage_timing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"wo_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WO-2026-0921-4471\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WAITING_INSPECTION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WAITING_MATERIAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"flag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXCEEDED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"IN_REPAIR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WAITING_SHIPMENT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"flag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NEAR_LIMIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dominant_bottleneck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WAITING_MATERIAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该工单超期由料件等待主导，指向备件计划而非维修产能\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dominant_bottleneck</code> 字段把这个分析自动化，避免每次超期都靠人工翻记录。这类归因数据积累起来，会揭示一些系统性问题——比如某类料件的到货周期长期偏长，应当在备件计划层面解决，而不是在工单层面催办。</p>\n<h2 id=\"料件核销率与账册健康\">料件核销率与账册健康</h2><h3 id=\"核销率的两种读法\">核销率的两种读法</h3><p>料件核销率是&quot;已耗用 ÷ 已进口保税料件&quot;。这个比值低有两种完全不同的解释，必须区分。第一种是<strong>正常的</strong>：料件刚到、订单还在排期，耗用还没发生。第二种是<strong>异常的</strong>：料件已经闲置过久，可能是需求预测失误，也可能是账册虚增了进口量。第一种随周期推进自然改善，第二种不会。</p>\n<p>因此报告不应只给一个比值，而应给出<strong>账龄结构</strong>：按料件在库时长分桶，看有多少料件停留在高账龄区间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 保税料件账龄结构&#10;SELECT&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN now() - received_at &lt; interval &#39;30 days&#39;  THEN &#39;0-30d&#39;&#10;    WHEN now() - received_at &lt; interval &#39;90 days&#39;  THEN &#39;31-90d&#39;&#10;    WHEN now() - received_at &lt; interval &#39;180 days&#39; THEN &#39;91-180d&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;180d+&#39;&#10;  END AS age_bucket,&#10;  sum(current_qty) AS qty,&#10;  sum(current_qty * unit_value) AS value&#10;FROM repair_ledger_item&#10;WHERE subject = &#39;MATERIAL&#39;&#10;  AND is_bonded_material = true&#10;  AND current_qty &gt; 0&#10;GROUP BY 1&#10;ORDER BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 保税料件账龄结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> received_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0-30d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> received_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '31-90d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> received_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '91-180d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '180d+'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MATERIAL'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_bonded_material </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>180d+</code> 桶是核销前最需要处理的部分。这些料件的三个结局——随整机出境、结转下期、或补税内销——必须在核销前确定，拖到核销时再决定就会挤压申报窗口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"差异率与成因结构\">差异率与成因结构</h3><p>账册差异率是盘点结果除以盘点总量。它本身是个弱指标：一个管理良好的维修中心差异率可能是千分之几，一个管理粗放的可能是百分之几，但两者都可能&quot;稳定&quot;。真正有诊断力的是<strong>差异的成因结构</strong>，尤其是无成因差异的占比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异成因</th>\n<th>对应的流程缺陷</th>\n<th>改进方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工单未及时关闭</td>\n<td>工单管理松弛</td>\n<td>收紧时长阈值，自动关闭提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副产物无凭证</td>\n<td>处置流程漏报</td>\n<td>处置路由强制化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已修复未出境</td>\n<td>物流或单证滞后</td>\n<td>出境时效监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退料未回写</td>\n<td>仓库作业纪律</td>\n<td>退料即时录入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无成因</td>\n<td>未知</td>\n<td>立案追查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前四类都是可改的流程问题，第五类是不可接受的。因此差异率指标的告警逻辑应当<strong>以无成因差异为主</strong>，而不是以总差异率为主——把告警绑在总差异率上，会导致团队把精力花在压低有成因差异的数字上，而不是消灭未知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在区敞口与担保的联动\">在区敞口与担保的联动</h2><p>在区敞口是第 3 章担保额度监控的直接输入。它等于在区货物对应暂缓税款之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>open</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>在区未处置</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{open}} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{在区未处置}} V_i \\times \\left(r_{\\text{duty}} + r_{\\text{vat}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">open</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">在区未处置</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个数字的三个用途：监控担保额度的占用比、预测核销时的税负规模、以及作为业务扩张的容量信号。它涨得快不一定是坏事——可能只是业务在增长；但如果涨得快而担保额度不变，就是一次可预见的停摆。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dashboard&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;as_of&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot;,&#10;    &quot;book_id&quot;: &quot;LB-2026-0017&quot;,&#10;    &quot;cycle_progress_ratio&quot;: 0.49,&#10;    &quot;open_exposure&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;value&quot;: 3120000.0,&#10;      &quot;guarantee_limit&quot;: 8000000.0,&#10;      &quot;utilization&quot;: 0.39&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;metrics&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;median_repair_days&quot;: 11,&#10;      &quot;over_60d_ratio&quot;: 0.021,&#10;      &quot;material_writeoff_ratio&quot;: 0.64,&#10;      &quot;variance_rate&quot;: 0.003,&#10;      &quot;unexplained_ratio&quot;: 0.0001,&#10;      &quot;byproduct_disposal_rate&quot;: 0.997&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;guards&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cycle_progress_vs_aging&quot;: &quot;OK&quot;,&#10;      &quot;exposure_vs_guarantee&quot;: &quot;OK&quot;,&#10;      &quot;unexplained_variance&quot;: &quot;OK&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dashboard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"as_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"book_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LB-2026-0017\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cycle_progress_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.49</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"open_exposure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3120000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"guarantee_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.39</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"median_repair_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">11</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"over_60d_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.021</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material_writeoff_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"variance_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.003</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unexplained_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"byproduct_disposal_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.997</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"guards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cycle_progress_vs_aging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"exposure_vs_guarantee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unexplained_variance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OK\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>guards</code> 这三个字段是这份看板的执行摘要——它们是前面所有指标的组合判断，决策者只需要看这三个是否 OK。把复杂的指标收敛成有限的几个守卫，是避免看板被忽略的关键：<strong>一个需要解读十二个数字才能判断好坏的看板，最终没有人会看</strong>。</p>\n<p>这里的三个守卫各自对应本 hub 的一条主线。<code>cycle_progress_vs_aging</code> 把核销周期的进度与在区货物的账龄放在一起看，老化速度快于周期进度就说明处置在拖，其数据来源是 <a href=\"bonded-ledger-count-audit\">保税维修账册盘点与海关核查</a> 建立的账龄分桶。<code>exposure_vs_guarantee</code> 是 <a href=\"../entry-reexport-writeoff/repair-goods-entry-declaration\">进境维修货物申报与担保</a> 里敞口监控的延续，逼近担保上限就必须在业务侧干预。<code>unexplained_variance</code> 是账册健康的最终判据——它源自第 2 章的工单耗用与处置凭证是否完整，<a href=\"../bonded-material-ledger/scrap-replaced-part-disposal\">边角料/坏件/替换件处置</a> 中任何一笔漏登记的副产物都会在这里显现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保税维修的指标是双向计分的：既看维修效率，也看账册健康；核销周期是统一两者的硬约束。</li>\n<li>维修周期应按工单创建到关闭度量，并同时给出中位数与尾部指标；<code>over_60d_ratio</code> 是最该设阈值的运营红线。</li>\n<li>超期归因应把工单拆成待检测、待料件、维修中、待出境四段分别计时，<code>dominant_bottleneck</code> 可自动指向系统性瓶颈。</li>\n<li>料件核销率需配合账龄结构阅读；<code>180d+</code> 桶的料件必须在核销前确定结局。</li>\n<li>差异率告警应以无成因差异为主而非总差异率；敞口指标与担保额度联动，看板最终收敛为少数几个守卫字段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>到这里，本 hub 的四条主线已经闭环：准入决定谁能修，账册记录用了什么，申报与核销证明货去了哪里，核查与指标保证这套账长期站得住。第四篇给出的看板是把前面十一篇的约束变成日常可观测信号的落点——<strong>如果这些守卫长期是 OK 的，说明整套监管模型在你的业务里真的运转起来了</strong>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维修周期/料件核销率与运营指标","id":"维修周期-料件核销率与运营指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"维修周期的度量与瓶颈","id":"维修周期的度量与瓶颈"},{"level":3,"text":"从工单创建到关闭","id":"从工单创建到关闭"},{"level":3,"text":"时长异常的归因维度","id":"时长异常的归因维度"},{"level":2,"text":"料件核销率与账册健康","id":"料件核销率与账册健康"},{"level":3,"text":"核销率的两种读法","id":"核销率的两种读法"},{"level":3,"text":"差异率与成因结构","id":"差异率与成因结构"},{"level":2,"text":"在区敞口与担保的联动","id":"在区敞口与担保的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"维修货物不得境内销售合规管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/repair-supervision-ops/no-domestic-sale-compliance"},"next":null}